    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>路易威登推出中文播客节目Louis Vuitton [EXTENDED] 。第一季节目，Louis Vuitton [EXTENDED]将从全新上海《城市指南》出发，伴随着路易威登于上海苏州河畔启幕的“侬好，上海”限时空间，邀请作家、演员、导演等来自各个行业的创意工作者展开观察与对话，一起探索上海这座城市的过去、现在与未来，感受属于上海的独特气质。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目将于10月11日起正式上线，敬请期待。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 互动方式 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@</span><a href="https://s.weibo.com/weibo?q=%2525E8%2525B7%2525AF%2525E6%252598%252593%2525E5%2525A8%252581%2525E7%252599%2525BB" data-url="https://s.weibo.com/weibo?q=%2525E8%2525B7%2525AF%2525E6%252598%252593%2525E5%2525A8%252581%2525E7%252599%2525BB"><span>路易威登</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：路易威登</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b40d11de8ac2b0d7d1b9520?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5dbabf83000000000100b469&amp;apptime=1695709452" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b40d11de8ac2b0d7d1b9520?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5dbabf83000000000100b469&amp;apptime=1695709452"><span>路易威登</span></a></p>]]></description>
